{"ref":"BDB, לָוָה²","hw":"לָוָה²","html":"† II. <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">לָוָה</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. borrow (</strong>NH <em>id.;</em> cf. Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">لَوَى</span> <em>delay payment of debt</em> (cf. BA<sup>ES 12</sup>)<strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Pf. 1 pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">לָוִי֫נוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 5:4\" href=\"/Nehemiah.5.4\">Ne 5:4</a>; Impf. 2 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּלְוֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:12\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.12\">Dt 28:12</a>; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">לֹוֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 22:7\" href=\"/Proverbs.22.7\">Pr 22:7</a> + 2 times;—<em>borrow</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עֶבֶד לֹוֶה לְאִישׁ מַלְוֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 22:7\" href=\"/Proverbs.22.7\">Pr 22:7</a> <em>a borrower is slave to a man who lends;</em> abs. <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:12\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.12\">Dt 28:12</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 24:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.24.2\">Is 24:2</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 37:21\" href=\"/Psalms.37.21\">ψ 37:21</a>; sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">כֶּסֶף</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 5:4\" href=\"/Nehemiah.5.4\">Ne 5:4</a>.<br><strong>Hiph.</strong>  Pf. 2 ms. consec. <span dir=\"rtl\">וְהִלְוִיתָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:12\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.12\">Dt 28:12</a>; Impf. 3 ms. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יַלְוְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:44\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.44\">Dt 28:44</a>; 2 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּלְוֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:24\" href=\"/Exodus.22.24\">Ex 22:24</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּלְוֶנּוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:44\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.44\">Dt 28:44</a>; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַלְוֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 37:26\" href=\"/Psalms.37.26\">ψ 37:26</a> + 3 times, cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַלְוֵה</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:17\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.17\">Pr 19:17</a>;—<em>cause to borrow</em>, i.e. <em>lend to</em>, c. acc. pers. + <span dir=\"rtl\">כֶּסֶף</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:24\" href=\"/Exodus.22.24\">Ex 22:24</a> (E); c. acc. pers. <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:12\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.12\">Dt 28:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:44\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.44\">44</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; abs. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 37:26\" href=\"/Psalms.37.26\">ψ 37:26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 112:5\" href=\"/Psalms.112.5\">112:5</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אִישׁ מַלְוֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 22:7\" href=\"/Proverbs.22.7\">Pr 22:7</a> (v. <strong>Qal</strong> supr.); as subst. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 24:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.24.2\">Is 24:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַלְוֵה י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:17\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.17\">Pr 19:17</a> <em>a lender to</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> is one shewing favour to the poor.","next":"BDB, לוה","prev":"BDB, לָוָה"}